Modified upstream files
-----------------------

Kyvernetria modifies the following upstream Kubernetes files, through the
patches in kubernetes/patches/:

  cmd/kube-controller-manager/app/controller_descriptor.go
  pkg/apis/core/v1/defaults.go
  pkg/controlplane/apiserver/options/options.go
  pkg/kubeapiserver/options/plugins.go
  pkg/scheduler/apis/config/v1/default_plugins.go
  pkg/scheduler/framework/plugins/names/names.go
  pkg/scheduler/framework/plugins/registry.go
  pkg/scheduler/schedule_one.go
  plugin/pkg/auth/authorizer/rbac/bootstrappolicy/controller_policy.go
  plugin/pkg/auth/authorizer/rbac/bootstrappolicy/policy.go
  staging/src/k8s.io/endpointslice/util/controller_utils.go

In addition, hack/update-test-expectations.sh adjusts upstream unit-test
expectations to Kyvernetria's changed defaults: it edits expected values in
upstream tests and test helpers, and regenerates the RBAC bootstrap-policy
test fixtures with upstream's own test. Test logic is not changed.
